DESCRIPTION >
    chat_events — every chat turn (app + /v1 API). 1 row ≈ 1 request.
SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime `json:$.timestamp`,
    `id_type` String `json:$.id_type`,
    `wallet` Nullable(String) `json:$.wallet`,
    `tokens` UInt64 `json:$.tokens`,
    `model` String `json:$.model`,
    `source` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.source`
ENGINE >
    MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY >
    timestamp, wallet
